(6753,'Use upper-case OR to get more results. Example: cat OR dog (content contains either \"cat\" or \"dog\").','','none'),
(6754,'You can use upper-case AND to require all words, but this is the same as the default behavior. Example: cat AND dog (same as cat dog, content must contain both \"cat\" and \"dog\").','','none'),
(6755,'Use quotes to search for a phrase. Example: \"the cat eats mice\".','','none'),
