(8484,'What are blocks?','','none'),
(8485,'Blocks are boxes of content rendered into an area, or region, of a web page of your site. Blocks are placed and configured specifically for each theme.','','none'),
(8486,'What is the block description?','','none'),
(8487,'The block description is an identification name for a block, which is shown in the administrative interface. It is not displayed on the site.','','none'),
(8488,'What is the block title?','','none'),
(8489,'The block title is the heading that is optionally shown to site visitors when the block is placed in a region.','','none'),
