(8700,'Drag any fields that you do not wish to see in the display to the <em>Disabled</em> section.','','none'),
(8701,'In the <em>Label</em> column, select the position for each field label in the display, or <em>- Hidden -</em> to hide a label. You can also choose <em>- Visually Hidden-</em> if you want the label\'s text to appear in the HTML page, so that screen readers and search engines can read it, but it will not be visible.','','none'),
(8702,'In the <em>Format</em> column, select the formatter for displaying each field.','','none'),
(8703,'After selecting the desired formatters, click the settings gear in each row to change the settings for the formatter.','','none'),
(8704,'When you are done making changes, click <em>Save</em>.','','none'),
(8705,'Test the display for your entity sub-type by viewing an entity. If needed, return to these steps to further refine the display.','','none'),
