(9058,'Under <em>Displays</em>, click <em>Add</em>.','','none'),
(9059,'In the pop-up list, click the link for the type of display you want to add; the most common types are <em>Page</em> and <em>Block</em>. The new display will be added to your view, and you will be editing that display.','','none'),
(9060,'Optionally, click the link next to <em>Display name</em> and enter a new name to be shown for this display in the administrative interface.','','none'),
