(11439,'User ID enables the analysis of groups of sessions, across devices, using a unique, persistent, and non-personally identifiable ID string representing a user. <a href=\":url\">Learn more about the benefits of using User ID</a>.','','11.4.11'),
(11440,'Show page titles as hierarchy like breadcrumbs','','11.4.11'),
(11441,'By default Matomo tracks the current page title and shows you a flat list of the most popular titles. This enables a breadcrumbs like tree view.','','11.4.11'),
(11442,'Hide home page from hierarchy','','11.4.11'),
(11443,'If enabled, the \"Home\" item will be removed from the hierarchy to flatten the structure in the Matomo statistics. Hits to the home page will still be counted, but for other pages the hierarchy will start at level Home+1.','','11.4.11'),
(11444,'Page titles hierarchy','','11.4.11'),
