(11483,'If checked, the tracking code is disabled generally. This may be useful when using Matomo Tag Manager.','','11.4.11'),
(11484,'Locally cache tracking code file','','11.4.11'),
(11485,'If checked, the tracking code file is retrieved from your Matomo site and cached locally. It is updated daily to ensure updates to tracking code are reflected in the local copy.','','11.4.11'),
(11486,'Track translation sets as one unit','','11.4.11'),
(11487,'When a node is part of a translation set, record statistics for the originating node instead. This allows for a translation set to be treated as a single unit.','','11.4.11'),
