(11794,'Provides tools for auditing and analyzing Drupal sites.','','11.4.11'),
(11795,'Enables all production-ready audit submodules at once. Excludes code analysis modules (phpcs, phpstan, rector) which require external tools.','','11.4.11'),
(11796,'Analyzes content volume by entity type, bundle, and language. Detects empty bundles, revision bloat, and translation gaps.','','11.4.11'),
(11797,'Analyzes menu structure, depth, and identifies navigation issues.','','11.4.11'),
(11798,'Analyzes block types, block instances, their placement and cache configuration.','','11.4.11'),
(11799,'Analyzes cron tasks, queue workers, and cron execution status.','','11.4.11'),
(11800,'Analyzes installed modules and themes, detects unused extensions, and provides recommendations based on project type.','','11.4.11'),
(11801,'Analyzes pending module and theme updates, including security updates.','','11.4.11'),
(11802,'Analyzes cache bins, configuration, efficiency, and cache-related best practices.','','11.4.11'),
(11803,'Analyzes code complexity metrics (LOC, cyclomatic complexity, maintainability index) for custom modules and themes using phploc. Requires phploc binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive.','','11.4.11'),
(11804,'Detects duplicated code (copy-paste / clones) in custom modules and themes using jscpd. Requires jscpd (Node.js npm package) installed globally. Not recommended for production environments.','','11.4.11'),
(11805,'Scores this environment against the configuration values and installed modules it declares, and exposes the result as a block and in the Navigation bar.','','11.4.11'),
(11806,'Analyzes database size, table sizes, and potentially problematic tables.','','11.4.11'),
(11807,'Analyzes entity fields, bundles, and view modes.','','11.4.11'),
(11808,'Exposes /audit/health, protected by a secret, for uptime monitors and load balancers: 200 OK while the selected audits reach their minimum scores and the database, cron, files and cache checks pass, 503 FAIL otherwise. Enabling the module creates the endpoint.','','11.4.11'),
(11809,'Analyzes image display configuration including image styles, responsive styles, breakpoints, and field formatters.','','11.4.11'),
(11810,'Analyzes multilingual configuration and translation status.','','11.4.11'),
(11811,'Analyzes performance configuration, cache settings, cache modules status, and detects cache issues in custom code.','','11.4.11'),
(11812,'Runs PHP CodeSniffer with Drupal coding standards. Requires phpcs binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive.','','11.4.11'),
(11813,'Runs PHPStan static analysis on custom code. Requires phpstan binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive and may expose sensitive code paths.','','11.4.11'),
(11814,'Analyzes the test structure of custom modules: counts test files per suite (Unit, Kernel, Functional, FunctionalJavascript) and flags modules without unit tests. Tests are not executed; run them in CI/CD instead.','','11.4.11'),
(11815,'Audits Search API configuration including indexes and servers status.','','11.4.11'),
(11816,'Performs security audits to detect configuration errors and potential vulnerabilities.','','11.4.11'),
(11817,'Analyzes SEO configuration, modules, and image optimization.','','11.4.11'),
(11818,'Analyzes Drupal system status including PHP, MySQL, and core versions.','','11.4.11'),
(11819,'Analyzes Twig templates for unused fields and best practices.','','11.4.11'),
(11820,'Analyzes URL aliases and redirects (loops, collisions, broken targets, route shadowing). Path Alias and Redirect modules are detected at runtime; only applicable groups are checked.','','11.4.11'),
(11821,'Analyzes Views displays, cache settings, and Search API usage.','','11.4.11'),
(11822,'Analyzes database logging (watchdog) for errors, warnings, and performance issues.','','11.4.11'),
