(12547,'Install the maintained phploc fork by Chris Gmyr. This is a drop-in replacement that supports PHP 8.x and Symfony Console 6+/7+.','','11.4.11'),
(12548,'Verify installation. You should see: \"phploc X.Y.Z by Chris Gmyr.\"','','11.4.11'),
(12549,'How to install phploc for code complexity analysis','','11.4.11'),
(12550,'phploc is a lightweight tool that quickly measures the size and structure of PHP projects, including lines of code, cyclomatic complexity, and class/method statistics.','','11.4.11'),
(12551,'IMPORTANT: Do NOT install phploc/phploc (the original by Sebastian Bergmann). It is abandoned since 2023 and incompatible with Drupal 10/11. Use cmgmyr/phploc instead.','','11.4.11'),
(12552,'Cyclomatic complexity and the Maintainability Index are computed natively (no external tool required); phploc only adds aggregate size/structure metrics.','','11.4.11'),
(12553,'The analysis focuses on custom modules and themes in modules/custom/ and themes/custom/ directories.','','11.4.11'),
